  "translation": "Akaenda kutoka huko, akamkuta ⟨את⟩ Yehonadabu bin Rekabu akikija kumlaki, akambariki, akamwambia: Je, ⟨את⟩ moyo wako una uadilifu kama moyo wangu ulivyo pamoja na moyo wako? Naye Yehonadabu akasema: Una. ⟨Tena⟩ una. ⟨Basi⟩ nipe ⟨את⟩ mkono wako. Naye akampa mkono wake, akampandisha kwake juu ya gari.",
